{"id":"s3.2.3","slug":"performing-operations-in-other-bases","title":"Performing Operations","content":"<p class=\"mb-4\">Arithmetic in other bases follows the same principles as base-10, with adjustments for carrying and borrowing.</p><ul class=\"list-disc pl-6 space-y-2 mb-4\"><li><strong>Addition:</strong> Sum digits column by column. If the sum in a column is greater than or equal to the base $n$, divide the sum by $n$. The remainder is the digit for that column, and the quotient is carried to the next column.</li><li><strong>Subtraction:</strong> If you need to borrow, you take 1 from the next higher place value and add the base $n$ to the current column.</li><li><strong>Multiplication:</strong> Use the FOILing method, but perform all calculations in base-10 and then convert each step's result (and carry) back to the target base.</li></ul>","summary":"Arithmetic in other bases follows the same principles as base-10, with adjustments for carrying and borrowing.","generation_guideline":"Generate a problem involving arithmetic (addition, subtraction, or multiplication) in a base other than 10.","questions":[{"id":1,"text":"Calculate $112_6 + 4_6$.","answer":"120","kind":"exact","tags":["arithmetic","bases"]},{"id":2,"text":"Calculate $53_6 \\times 4_6$.","answer":"340","kind":"exact","tags":["arithmetic","bases"]},{"id":3,"text":"Calculate $101_2 - 11_2$.","answer":"10","kind":"exact","tags":["arithmetic","bases"]},{"id":4,"text":"Calculate $44_5 \\times 4_5$.","answer":"341","kind":"exact","tags":["arithmetic","bases"]},{"id":5,"text":"Calculate $26_9 \\div 6_9$.","answer":"4","kind":"exact","tags":["arithmetic","bases"]},{"id":6,"text":"Calculate $37_8 + 56_8$.","answer":"115","kind":"exact","tags":["arithmetic","bases"]},{"id":7,"text":"Calculate $88_9 + 82_9$.","answer":"181","kind":"exact","tags":["arithmetic","bases"]},{"id":8,"text":"Calculate $100_6 - 44_6$.","answer":"12","kind":"exact","tags":["arithmetic","bases"]},{"id":9,"text":"Calculate $104_8 - 47_